 75GE cL E(B)$The relative order of the 862 and 1135|g cascade connecting       
 75GE2cL the 2197.5 and 200.3 levels is not known. This cascade defines         
 75GE3cL a level at 1063.0 or at 1335.2 (see (d,p|g)). There is a level         
 75GE4cL observed at 1062 in (t,p) and if it corresponds to the above           
 75GE5cL level, it eliminates the alternate 1335 level. The 862.3|g is          
 75GE6cL then assigned to 1063 level with 100% branching and the 1135|g         
 75GE7cL entirely to the 2197 level.                                            
 75GE cL E(D)$The relative order of 888.8 and 1302.7|g cascade connecting       
 75GE2cL the 2383 and 192.5 levels is not known. This cascade defines a         
 75GE3cL level at 1080.6 or 1494.6                                              
